# Title: Potential Discovery Activity Using Find - Linux
# ID: 8344c0e5-5783-47cc-9cf9-a0f7fd03e6cf
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-12-28
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1083
# Description: Detects usage of "find" binary in a suspicious manner to perform discovery
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(process.executable:*/find AND (process.command_line:*-perm -4000* OR process.command_line:*-perm -2000* OR process.command_line:*-perm 0777* OR process.command_line:*-perm -222* OR process.command_line:*-perm -o w* OR process.command_line:*-perm -o x* OR process.command_line:*-perm -u=s* OR process.command_line:*-perm -g=s*))
